<p style="line-height:1.38; background-color:#ffffff; padding:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt"><span style="font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#414141"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">The use of noise-canceling headphones can transform lives for children who suffer from sensory hypersensitivity or ADHD. They can reduce the overwhelming auditory stimulation they help create a calm learning atmosphere that allows all students to succeed.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

