<h3 class="d7a845b324cb21bd2c44fe9ac1c7dd190 mt-2" id="Audio in Learning">Audio in Learning</h3>
<div><p>In terms of engaging students in today's multi-media-rich classrooms immersive audio can be an important game changer. Be it exploring virtual reality, listening to educational podcasts or learning languages, audio technology can make learning more engaging and memorable. For schools and educators using the appropriate equipment, including <a href="https://www.encoredataproducts.com/bulk-quantity-disposable-headphones/">headsets and headphones that are disposable</a>, is key to ensure that every student benefits of these experiences.<br />
